{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51841","headline":"江亭晚眺 · 觉隐","name":"江亭晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独隐清江秋思长，晚潮初上水亭凉。\n海门云起双峦暝，一抹银花影夕阳。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》七八五《安庆府部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"觉隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}